# GameVox fork: local secrets
#
# NOTE: .env is TRACKED by upstream (it holds their dotenvx-encrypted values),
# so it can never be protected by an ignore rule -- ignore rules do not apply
# to files already in the index. Put your bot token in .env.local and pass it
# with `docker compose --env-file .env.local`. Never write it into .env.
.env.local
.env.*.local
